  "title": "The American Lawyer reports on Burford's record 2023 results",
  "summary": "The American Lawyer reports on Burford Capital's record 2023 results. CEO Christopher Bogart is quoted: \"'We did more than a billion dollars in new business, more than we’ve ever done. What that is showing is the level of demand and market interest for these solutions,' said Burford CEO Christopher Bogart. 'Now that the pandemic is fully behind us and the courts are fully open, we have a $7 billion litigation portfolio.'\"",
